# Files that must not be published. gitignore syntax.
#
# VERIFIED against the live Worker: every path below returns 404 while the site
# itself is unaffected. Two Cloudflare doc pages describe assets.directory,
# html_handling and not_found_handling without mentioning this file, so it is
# worth re-testing after any change to how the site is deployed.
#
# Nothing here is secret in any case: tools/ holds the SEO build scripts, and a
# scan for key, token and private-key patterns found only the word "token" from
# tokenization and token bucket.
tools
cf-build.sh
staticwebapp.config.json
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
.github
README.md
